      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `embed_for_search.py` file, I need to use an external provider for generating embeddings. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider for generating embeddings. The code will include the necessary imports and API calls to interact with Amazon Bedrock. </thinking>\n",
