        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `similarity_score.py` that computes cosine similarity between two embedded texts using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to various AI models, including those for computing embeddings and similarity scores. The provider-identifying signal will be the import of the `bedrock` client from the `boto3` library, which is specific to AWS services. </thinking>\n",
