        "text": "<thinking> To create the `embed_batch.py` file that generates embeddings for a batch of texts using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a suitable provider for generating embeddings. The code will import the necessary modules from the Amazon Bedrock SDK and use the `bedrock-runtime` client to call the embeddings API. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `bedrock-runtime` client. </thinking>\n",
